> Leading 2017 Isle of Man TT newcomer Adam McLean will be at this year’s Armoy Road Races.
The big event will take place on Friday and Saturday, July 28-29.
Joining McLean, a previous winner of the Junior Support at Armoy, will be local men William Dunlop, Neil Kernohan, Paul Jordan, Darryl Tweed, Paul Robinson, Gary Dunlop, Hexham rider Dominic Herbertson and[ Moto]3/125 GP race winner Christian Elkin, winner of[ Moto]3/125 GP race in 2016.
